---
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description={`How ${SITE.name} handles your data, cookies and advertising, including Google ads and analytics.`}
  updated="October 2026"
>
  <p>
    This policy explains what information is collected when you use {SITE.domain} and how it is used. The site is run
    by {SITE.owner}, who is responsible for this policy. If you have a question, email
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>The numbers you enter</h2>
  <p>
    Our calculators run entirely in your browser. The figures you type, such as loan amounts or salaries, are not sent
    to us or stored on any server.
  </p>

  <h2>What your browser stores</h2>
  <p>
    We store at most two small settings in your browser's local storage: the country you chose, and whether you
    dismissed the country suggestion banner. They stay on your device, are never sent to us, and you can clear them
    at any time in your browser settings. We do not set cookies ourselves.
  </p>

  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>
    We use Google Analytics to understand how many people visit and which pages are useful. Google Analytics uses
    cookies to collect information such as the pages you view, how long you stay, your approximate location (based
    on your IP address), and your device and browser type. We do not use it to identify you personally. Learn more in
    <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener">how Google uses information from sites that use its services</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Advertising and cookies</h2>
  <p>
    We show ads from Google AdSense to keep the site free. Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve
    ads based on your previous visits to this website and other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies enables
    it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visits to this site and/or other sites on the internet.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      You can opt out of personalised advertising by visiting
      <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>.
    </li>
    <li>
      You can opt out of some third-party vendors' use of cookies for personalised advertising at
      <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="noopener">aboutads.info</a>.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    If you visit from the UK, the European Economic Area or Switzerland, you will be asked for consent before
    personalised ads or analytics cookies are used, and you can change your choice at any time.
  </p>

  <h2>Contacting us</h2>
  <p>
    If you email us, we use your email address and message only to reply. We don't add you to a mailing list or share
    your details.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>This site is intended for adults and is not directed at children under 13.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access, correct or delete personal data held about you, and
    to object to its use. Because we don't hold the figures you enter, most requests will concern Google's services;
    you can manage those through your Google account. For anything else, email us.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We will update this page if our practices change, and change the date at the top.</p>
</PageLayout>
